). It is said to have been formed by the solidification of the foam of the क्षीरसमुद्र (ocean of milk) and lies in its midst. It is situated 32000 yojanas (one yojana = 15 kms. or 9 miles) above the मेरु mountain (See MERU for details.).
It is inhabited by great devotees of विष्णु. They are absolutely white in complexion, of an extraordinarily strong constitution and extremely handsome. They are always worshipping and meditating upon विष्णु.
Once रावण is said to have gone there. But, the women of the place manhandled him and drove him out!
